This is an unofficial fan-made DSH interface skin.

Asuka Langley and Neon Genesis Evangelion are properties of their respective
rights holders. The character artwork in assets/asuka-unit-02-cutout.* was
created with OpenAI Image generation for this theme.

The DSH skin integration follows the public client-plugin and skin-manager
contracts used by dsh-web-ui and dsh-skin-switch.
